  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Financial Irresponsibility",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that Black men are financially irresponsible or prone to spending money recklessly, particularly in the context of relationships. This stereotype is used to frame the message that having multiple girlfriends leads to financial loss, reinforcing a harmful racialized narrative about Black men's economic competence.",
